@* 🟢 شاشة جديدة (لا مقابل مباشر لها فى الديسك توب): «طلبية عميل» بنظام الطلبيات الحديث (رأس + سطور) على جداول
   Customer_Orders / Customer_Order_Lines بدل Requests_Details القديم (Accounts.Requests.Add_Requests).
   خطة الطلبيات: .claude/docs/customer-orders-razor-plan.md. هذه المرحلة: إضافة/تعديل طلبية كمسودة أو مؤكدة.
   المؤجَّل لمراحله: العربون، السحب فى فاتورة المبيعات، الإلغاء بسبب، قائمة المتابعة، عرض الحجز/المتاح.
   اختيار الصنف يعيد استعمال AddInvoiceItemDialog نفسه (نفس الأسعار والأرصدة والوحدات). التعديل ممنوع بعد التنفيذ الجزئى/الإلغاء. *@
@page "/accounts/sales/customer-order/{Id:long?}"

@using System.Data
@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountModelsLib.Models
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Components.Shared
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject ISnackbar Snackbar
@inject NavigationManager Nav
@inject TabWorkspaceService TabWorkspace
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>@PageHeading</PageTitle>

<InvoiceStyles />

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.False" Class="mt-4" Style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">
<div class="inv-page">

    <div class="inv-head inv-card">
        <h1 class="inv-title">@PageHeading</h1>
        <div class="inv-badges">
            <span class="inv-chip primary"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Tag" Size="Size.Small" />@(_orderNo > 0 ? _orderNo.ToString() : Tr("InvoiceStatusNew"))</span>
            <span class="inv-chip @(_status == CustomerOrderStatus.Confirmed ? "success" : "warn")">@StatusText(_status)</span>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Add" Disabled="_isSaving" OnClick="NewOrder">@Tr("DstNewButton")</MudButton>
        </div>
    </div>

    @if (_locked)
    {
        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Class="mb-3">@Tr("COLockedMessage")</MudAlert>
    }

    @* ===== وضع المندوب (خطة المندوبين المرحلة 5): المندوب يأخذ الطلبية من مخزن يختاره، بفحوص البيع الفورى، وتُحفظ مؤكدة وتُسنَد له مع عربون اختيارى ===== *@
    @if (IsRepMode)
    {
        <div class="inv-card" aria-live="polite">
            @if (_repCtx is null)
            {
                <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Dense="true" role="alert">@(_repError ?? Tr("FSVNoRep"))</MudAlert>
            }
            else
            {
                <div class="inv-badges" style="flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">
                    <span class="inv-chip primary"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.LocalShipping" Size="Size.Small" />@Tr("FSNRepOrder"): @_repCtx.Rep_Name</span>
                    <span class="inv-chip">@Tr("FSRBox"): @_repCtx.Cash_Box_Name (@_repCtx.Cash_On_Hand.ToString("N2"))</span>
                    <span class="inv-chip @(_repCtx.CanSell ? "success" : "warn")">@Tr(_repCtx.Shift_Status is int st ? "FSSStatus_" + st : "FSSNoShift")</span>
                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Text" Size="Size.Small" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Assignment" Href="@($"/salesrep/orders?rep={_repCtx.Rep_Id}")">@Tr("FSOTitle")</MudButton>
                </div>
                @if (!_repCtx.CanSell)
                {
                    <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Warning" Dense="true" Class="mt-2" role="alert">@Tr("FSNNoOpenShift")</MudAlert>
                }
                <MudGrid Spacing="3" Class="mt-1">
                    <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="4">
                        <MudSelect T="long" Value="_repStoreId" ValueChanged="OnRepStoreChanged" Label="@Tr("FSNSourceStore")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                                   HelperText="@Tr("FSNSourceStoreHint")" Required="true">
                            @foreach (var s in _repStores)
                            {
                                <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@s.Id">@s.Name</MudSelectItem>
                            }
                        </MudSelect>
                    </MudItem>
                    <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                        <MudNumericField T="decimal" @bind-Value="_repDeposit" Label="@Tr("FSNDeposit")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Min="0" Format="N2" HideSpinButtons="true"
                                         HelperText="@Tr("FSNDepositHint")" Immediate="true" />
                    </MudItem>
                </MudGrid>
                @foreach (var w in _repWarnings)
                {
                    <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Warning" Dense="true" Class="mt-2">@w</MudAlert>
                }
                @if (_repViolations.Count > 0)
                {
                    <h3 class="inv-card-title mt-3"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Gavel" />@Tr("FSVApprovalsNeeded")</h3>
                    @foreach (var v in _repViolations)
                    {
                        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px">
                            <MudIcon Icon="@(v.Covered ? Icons.Material.Filled.CheckCircle : v.Approval_Status == 2 ? Icons.Material.Filled.Cancel : Icons.Material.Filled.HourglassTop)"
                                     Color="@(v.Covered ? Color.Success : v.Approval_Status == 2 ? Color.Error : Color.Warning)" Size="Size.Small" aria-hidden="true" />
                            <span>@v.Message</span>
                            <span class="inv-chip @(v.Covered ? "success" : "warn")">@Tr(v.Approval_Status is int s ? "FSVApproval_" + s : "FSVApprovalNone")</span>
                        </div>
                    }
                    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
                        <MudTextField T="string" @bind-Value="_repApprovalReason" Label="@Tr("FSVReason")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Margin="Margin.Dense" Style="min-width:240px" />
                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Warning" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Send" Disabled="@(_isSaving || _repViolations.All(v => v.Covered || v.Approval_Status == 0))" OnClick="@(() => RunRepCheckAsync(true))">@Tr("FSVRequestApproval")</MudButton>
                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Refresh" Disabled="_isSaving" OnClick="@(() => RunRepCheckAsync(false))">@Tr("FSVRefreshStatus")</MudButton>
                    </div>
                }
            }
        </div>
    }

    <div class="inv-card">
        <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Description" />@Tr("COHeaderTitle")</h2>
        <MudGrid Spacing="3">
            <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
                <MudAutocomplete T="LookupOption" Value="_customer" ValueChanged="OnCustomerChanged" SearchFunc="SearchCustomersAsync"
                                 ToStringFunc="@(c => c?.Name ?? "")" Label="@Tr("CustomerLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                                 CoerceText="false" ResetValueOnEmptyText="true" MaxItems="50" Required="true" Disabled="_locked" />
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudSelect T="long" @bind-Value="_currencyId" Label="@Tr("CurrencyLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Disabled="_locked">
                    @foreach (var c in _currencies)
                    {
                        <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@c.Id">@c.Name</MudSelectItem>
                    }
                </MudSelect>
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" @bind-Date="_orderDate" Label="@Tr("DateColumn")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Disabled="_locked" />
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" @bind-Date="_expectedDate" Label="@Tr("COExpectedDateLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Disabled="_locked" />
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" md="9">
                <MudTextField T="string" @bind-Value="_notes" Label="@Tr("NotesLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Lines="2" AutoGrow="true" Disabled="_locked" />
            </MudItem>
        </MudGrid>
    </div>

    <div class="inv-card">
        <div class="inv-card-head">
            <h2 class="inv-card-title">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ShoppingCart" />@Tr("COItemsHeader")
                @if (_lines.Count > 0)
                {
                    <span class="inv-count">@_lines.Count</span>
                }
            </h2>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Add"
                       OnClick="OpenAddItemDialog" Disabled="@(_customer is null || _locked || (IsRepMode && _repStoreId <= 0))">@Tr("AddItemButton")</MudButton>
        </div>

        <MudTable Items="@_lines" T="IInvoices_Details" Hover="true" Striped="true" Bordered="true" Dense="true" Elevation="0">
            <HeaderContent>
                <MudTh>#</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("ItemNameColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("QuantityColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("COAvailabilityColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("UnitPriceColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("NetTotalColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh></MudTh>
            </HeaderContent>
            <RowTemplate>
                <MudTd DataLabel="#">@(_lines.IndexOf(context) + 1)</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("ItemNameColumn")">
                    <b>@context.Invoice_Item_Name</b>
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(context.Store_Name))
                    {
                        <br /><small class="mud-text-secondary">@context.Store_Name</small>
                    }
                </MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("QuantityColumn")" Style="text-align:end">@FormatQnty(context)</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("COAvailabilityColumn")">
                    @if (context.Unit_Item_Table_Id is long uid && _avail.TryGetValue(uid, out var av))
                    {
                        var shortL = (context.Larg_Qnty ?? 0) > av.AvailL;
                        var shortS = (context.Small_Qnty ?? 0) > av.AvailS;
                        <div>
                            <b class="@(shortL || shortS ? "mud-error-text" : "mud-success-text")">@Tr("COAvailableLabel") @AvailText(av.AvailL, av.AvailS, context)</b>
                            <br /><small class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("COBalanceLabel") @AvailText(av.BalL, av.BalS, context) · @Tr("COReservedLabel") @AvailText(av.ResL, av.ResS, context)</small>
                            @if (shortL || shortS)
                            {
                                <br /><small class="mud-error-text">@Tr("COShortageWarning")</small>
                            }
                        </div>
                    }
                </MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("UnitPriceColumn")" Style="text-align:end">@((context.PriceUnit ?? 0).ToString("N2"))</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("NetTotalColumn")" Style="text-align:end">
                    <b>@((context.Item_Net_Total_Price ?? 0).ToString("N2"))</b>
                    @if ((context.Net_Total_Item_Commission ?? 0) > 0)
                    {
                        <br /><small class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("FSNLineDiscount", (context.Net_Total_Item_Commission ?? 0).ToString("N2"))</small>
                    }
                </MudTd>
                <MudTd Style="white-space:nowrap">
                    <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.EditNote" Size="Size.Medium" Disabled="_locked" OnClick="@(() => OpenEditItemDialog(context))" aria-label="@Tr("EditItemLabel")" />
                    <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.DeleteOutline" Size="Size.Medium" Color="Color.Error" Disabled="_locked" OnClick="@(() => DeleteLine(context))" aria-label="@Tr("DeleteItemLabel")" />
                </MudTd>
            </RowTemplate>
            <NoRecordsContent>
                <MudText Align="Align.Center" Class="py-4 mud-text-secondary">@Tr("NoItemsMessage")</MudText>
            </NoRecordsContent>
        </MudTable>

        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_errorMessage))
        {
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Dense="true" Class="mt-3">@_errorMessage</MudAlert>
        }
    </div>

    @* ===== التنفيذ: المطلوب / المنفَّذ / المتبقى لكل صنف + تحويل إلى فاتورة (كلياً أو جزئياً) + إغلاق المتبقى ===== *@
    @if (_orderId > 0 && _status != CustomerOrderStatus.Draft && _orderLines.Count > 0)
    {
        <div class="inv-card">
            <div class="inv-card-head">
                <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.LocalShipping" />@Tr("COFulfillTitle")</h2>
                @if (_canFulfill)
                {
                    <MudStack Row="true" Spacing="2" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center">
                        <MudSelect T="int" @bind-Value="_invoiceAgile" Label="@Tr("COInvoiceKind")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Margin="Margin.Dense" Style="min-width:140px">
                            <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="1">@Tr("DS_InvoiceCredit")</MudSelectItem>
                            <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="0">@Tr("DS_InvoiceCash")</MudSelectItem>
                        </MudSelect>
                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ReceiptLong"
                                   Disabled="@(!HasAllocation)" OnClick="ConvertToInvoice">@Tr("COConvertButton")</MudButton>
                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Warning" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.DoNotDisturbOn"
                                   OnClick="@(() => { _showCloseRemaining = true; _closeReason = ""; })">@Tr("COCloseRemainingButton")</MudButton>
                    </MudStack>
                }
            </div>

            @if (_showCloseRemaining)
            {
                <MudPaper Class="pa-3 mb-3" Outlined="true">
                    <MudTextField T="string" @bind-Value="_closeReason" Label="@Tr("COCloseRemainingReason")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Lines="2" Immediate="true" />
                    <MudStack Row="true" Spacing="2" Class="mt-2">
                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Warning" Disabled="@(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_closeReason) || _isSaving)" OnClick="CloseRemainingAsync">@Tr("COCloseRemainingConfirm")</MudButton>
                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" OnClick="@(() => _showCloseRemaining = false)">@Tr("Cancel")</MudButton>
                    </MudStack>
                </MudPaper>
            }

            <MudSimpleTable Dense="true" Bordered="true" Striped="true" Style="overflow-x:auto">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>@Tr("ItemNameColumn")</th>
                        <th style="text-align:end">@Tr("CORequiredColumn")</th>
                        <th style="text-align:end">@Tr("COFulfilledQtyColumn")</th>
                        <th style="text-align:end">@Tr("COClosedQtyColumn")</th>
                        <th style="text-align:end">@Tr("CORemainingColumn")</th>
                        @if (_canFulfill)
                        {
                            <th style="min-width:210px">@Tr("COThisInvoiceColumn")</th>
                        }
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    @for (var i = 0; i < _orderLines.Count; i++)
                    {
                        var ol = _orderLines[i];
                        var disp = i < _lines.Count ? _lines[i] : null;
                        var remL = CustomerOrdersService.RemainingLarg(ol);
                        var remS = CustomerOrdersService.RemainingSmall(ol);
                        var alloc = _alloc.TryGetValue(ol.Id, out var a) ? a : new AllocInput();
                        <tr>
                            <td><b>@(disp?.Invoice_Item_Name)</b></td>
                            <td style="text-align:end">@Qty(ol.Qty_Larg, ol.Qty_Small, disp)</td>
                            <td style="text-align:end">@Qty(ol.Fulfilled_Qty_Larg, ol.Fulfilled_Qty_Small, disp)</td>
                            <td style="text-align:end">@Qty(ol.Cancelled_Qty_Larg, ol.Cancelled_Qty_Small, disp)</td>
                            <td style="text-align:end"><b class="@(remL > 0 || remS > 0 ? "mud-warning-text" : "mud-success-text")">@Qty(remL, remS, disp)</b></td>
                            @if (_canFulfill)
                            {
                                <td>
                                    @if (remL > 0 || remS > 0)
                                    {
                                        <MudStack Row="true" Spacing="1">
                                            <MudNumericField T="decimal" @bind-Value="alloc.Larg" Max="remL" Min="0" Label="@(disp?.UnitStr)" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                                                             Margin="Margin.Dense" HideSpinButtons="true" Format="0.##" Immediate="true" Style="max-width:100px" />
                                            @if (remS > 0)
                                            {
                                                <MudNumericField T="decimal" @bind-Value="alloc.Small" Max="remS" Min="0" Label="@(disp?.UnitSmallStr)" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                                                                 Margin="Margin.Dense" HideSpinButtons="true" Format="0.##" Immediate="true" Style="max-width:100px" />
                                            }
                                        </MudStack>
                                    }
                                </td>
                            }
                        </tr>
                    }
                </tbody>
            </MudSimpleTable>

            @if (_orderInvoices.Count > 0)
            {
                <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1" Class="mt-4 mb-1 font-weight-bold">@Tr("COInvoicesTitle")</MudText>
                <MudSimpleTable Dense="true" Bordered="true" Striped="true" Style="overflow-x:auto">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>@Tr("COInvoiceNo")</th>
                            <th>@Tr("DateColumn")</th>
                            <th style="text-align:end">@Tr("NetTotalColumn")</th>
                            <th style="text-align:end">@Tr("CODepositApplied")</th>
                            <th></th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        @foreach (var inv in _orderInvoices)
                        {
                            <tr>
                                <td><b>@inv.InvoiceNo</b></td>
                                <td>@inv.Date.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)</td>
                                <td style="text-align:end">@inv.Net.ToString("N2")</td>
                                <td style="text-align:end">@AppliedFor(inv.InvoiceListId).ToString("N2")</td>
                                <td style="text-align:end">
                                    @if (_depositRemaining > 0 && AppliedFor(inv.InvoiceListId) < inv.Net)
                                    {
                                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Size="Size.Small" Color="Color.Success" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Payments" Class="me-1"
                                                   Disabled="_isApplying" OnClick="@(() => ApplyDepositAsync(inv))">@Tr("CODepositApply")</MudButton>
                                    }
                                    @* يفتح الفاتورة فى تبويب جديد (كل مسار له تبويبه فى نظام التبويبات) *@
                                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Size="Size.Small" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.OpenInNew"
                                               OnClick="@(() => OpenInvoiceTab(inv))">@Tr("COInvoiceData")</MudButton>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        }
                    </tbody>
                </MudSimpleTable>
            }
        </div>
    }

    @* ===== العربون: الإذونات النقدية المرتبطة بالطلبية (تُنشأ من إذن استلام النقدية بمحركه الأصلى) ===== *@
    @if (_orderId > 0 && _customer is not null && _status != CustomerOrderStatus.Cancelled)
    {
        <div class="inv-card">
            <div class="inv-card-head">
                <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Payments" />@Tr("CODepositsTitle")</h2>
                @if (_status != CustomerOrderStatus.Closed)
                {
                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Add"
                               OnClick="@(() => Nav.NavigateTo($"/accounts/cash/voucher-party?type=1&customer={_customer.Id}&order={_orderId}"))">@Tr("CODepositAdd")</MudButton>
                }
            </div>
            @if (_deposits.Count == 0)
            {
                <MudText Class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("CONoDeposits")</MudText>
            }
            else
            {
                <MudSimpleTable Dense="true" Bordered="true" Striped="true">
                    <thead><tr><th>@Tr("CVOrderNoLabel")</th><th>@Tr("DateColumn")</th><th style="text-align:end">@Tr("CVAmountLabel")</th><th style="text-align:end">@Tr("COConsumedColumn")</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        @foreach (var d in _deposits)
                        {
                            <tr><td>@(d.VoucherNo > 0 ? d.VoucherNo.ToString() : "")</td><td>@d.Date.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)</td><td style="text-align:end">@d.Amount.ToString("N2")</td><td style="text-align:end">@d.Consumed.ToString("N2")</td></tr>
                        }
                        <tr><td colspan="2"><b>@Tr("NetTotalColumn")</b></td><td style="text-align:end"><b>@_deposits.Sum(x => x.Amount).ToString("N2")</b></td><td style="text-align:end"><b>@_deposits.Sum(x => x.Consumed).ToString("N2")</b></td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </MudSimpleTable>
            }
        </div>
    }

    <div class="inv-dock" role="region">
        <div class="inv-dock-cells">
            <div class="cell"><span class="lbl">@Tr("LinesCountLabel")</span><b>@_lines.Count</b></div>
            <div class="cell net"><span class="lbl">@Tr("NetTotalColumn")</span><b>@NetTotal.ToString("N2")</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="inv-dock-actions">
            @if (IsRepMode)
            {
                @if (_repDeposit > 0)
                {
                    <span class="inv-chip">@Tr("FSNDeposit"): @_repDeposit.ToString("N2")</span>
                }
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.FactCheck"
                           Disabled="@(!CanSaveRep)" OnClick="@(() => RunRepCheckAsync(false))">@Tr("FSNCheck")</MudButton>
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.CheckCircle"
                           Disabled="@(!CanSaveRep)" OnClick="SaveRepAsync">@(_isSaving ? Tr("FSNSaving") : Tr("FSNSave"))</MudButton>
            }
            else
            {
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Save"
                           Disabled="@(!CanSave)" OnClick="@(() => SaveAsync(false))">@Tr("COSaveDraft")</MudButton>
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.CheckCircle"
                           Disabled="@(!CanSave)" OnClick="@(() => SaveAsync(true))">@Tr("COSaveConfirm")</MudButton>
            }
        </div>
    </div>

    <AddInvoiceItemDialog ShowExtraFields="@IsRepMode" FixedStoreId="@(IsRepMode ? _repStoreId : 0)" ShowItemsWithoutBalanceByDefault="true" Visible="_itemDialogOpen" PriceTypeId="_customerPriceTypeId" CustomerId="@(_customer?.Id ?? 0)"
                          VisibleChanged="@(v => _itemDialogOpen = v)" ExistingLine="_editingLine" OnItemAdded="OnItemDialogSaved" />
</div>
</MudContainer>

@code {
    [Parameter] public long? Id { get; set; }

    private record LookupOption(long Id, string Name);

    private readonly CustomerCLS _customerCls = new();
    private readonly CustomerOrdersService _service = new();

    private List<LookupOption> _currencies = new();
    private List<IInvoices_Details> _lines = new();
    private LookupOption? _customer;
    private long _currencyId;
    private long _customerPriceTypeId;
    private DateTime? _orderDate = DateTime.Now.Date;
    private DateTime? _expectedDate;
    private string? _notes;
    private long _orderId;
    private long _orderNo;
    private CustomerOrderStatus _status = CustomerOrderStatus.Draft;
    private bool _locked;
    private bool _isSaving;
    private string? _errorMessage;
    private bool _itemDialogOpen;
    private IInvoices_Details? _editingLine;
    private long _tempLineId;
    private long _loadedId = -1;

    // ===================== وضع المندوب (خطة المندوبين المرحلة 5: أخذ طلبية) =====================
    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "rep")] public long? RepQuery { get; set; }
    private bool IsRepMode => RepQuery is > 0 && (Id ?? 0) == 0 && _orderId == 0;
    private AccountModelsLib.SalesRep.SalesRepSaleService.SaleContext? _repCtx;
    private string? _repError;
    private List<AccountModelsLib.SalesRep.SalesRepOrderService.StoreRow> _repStores = new();
    private long _repStoreId;
    private decimal _repDeposit;
    private Guid _repDocGuid = Guid.NewGuid();
    private List<AccountModelsLib.SalesRep.SalesRepSaleService.Violation> _repViolations = new();
    private List<string> _repWarnings = new();
    private string? _repApprovalReason;
    private bool CanSaveRep => !_isSaving && _repCtx is { CanSell: true } && _customer is not null && _lines.Count > 0 && _repStoreId > 0;

    private async Task InitRepModeAsync()
    {
        if (!IsRepMode) return;
        try
        {
            var repId = RepQuery!.Value;
            (_repCtx, _repStores, _repStoreId) = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                var svc = new AccountModelsLib.SalesRep.SalesRepOrderService();
                return (new AccountModelsLib.SalesRep.SalesRepSaleService().GetContext(repId), svc.GetSourceStores(repId), svc.GetDefaultSourceStore(repId));
            });
            _expectedDate ??= DateTime.Today.AddDays(1);
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _repCtx = null; _repError = ex.Message; }
    }

    private async Task OnCustomerChanged(LookupOption? c)
    {
        _customer = c;
        _repViolations = new(); _repWarnings = new();
        _customerPriceTypeId = 0;
        if (c is null || !IsRepMode) return;
        // نوع سعر العميل، وإلا قائمة أسعار المندوب (كما فى فاتورة المندوب).
        var customerId = c.Id;
        var typeId = await Task.Run(() =>
        {
            AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
            var dt = new operations().return_DataTable("SELECT ISNULL(Price_Type_List_ID, 0) FROM Customer WHERE Id = " + customerId);
            return dt.Rows.Count > 0 ? Convert.ToInt64(dt.Rows[0][0]) : 0;
        });
        _customerPriceTypeId = typeId > 0 ? typeId : _repCtx?.Price_Type_List_ID ?? 0;
    }

    private void OnRepStoreChanged(long storeId)
    {
        if (storeId == _repStoreId) return;
        // الأسطر مرتبطة بأصناف المخزن السابق: تغيير المخزن يبدأ الأصناف من جديد.
        if (_lines.Count > 0) { _lines = new(); _avail = new(); Snackbar.Add(Tr("FSNStoreChangedClearsLines"), Severity.Info); }
        _repStoreId = storeId;
        _repViolations = new(); _repWarnings = new();
    }

    private AccountModelsLib.SalesRep.SalesRepOrderService.TakeOrderInput RepTakeInput() => new()
    {
        Doc_Guid = _repDocGuid,
        Customer_Id = _customer?.Id ?? 0,
        Source_Store_Id = _repStoreId,
        Currency_Id = _currencyId > 0 ? _currencyId : null,
        Expected_Delivery_Date = _expectedDate,
        Notes = _notes,
        Deposit = _repDeposit,
        Lines = _lines.Select(l => new AccountModelsLib.SalesRep.SalesRepOrderService.TakeOrderLine
        {
            Unit_Item_Id = l.Unit_Item_Table_Id ?? 0,
            Qty_Large = l.Larg_Qnty ?? 0,
            Qty_Small = l.Small_Qnty ?? 0,
            Unit_Price = l.PriceUnit ?? 0,
            Gross = l.Qnty_value ?? l.Total ?? 0,
            Discount_Value = l.Net_Total_Item_Commission ?? 0,
            Tax_Value = l.Item_TaxSales10_Value ?? 0,
            Line_Total = l.Item_Net_Total_Price ?? 0,
        }).ToList(),
    };

    private async Task RunRepCheckAsync(bool request)
    {
        if (_repCtx is null || _customer is null || _lines.Count == 0) return;
        _isSaving = true;
        _errorMessage = null;
        try
        {
            var repId = _repCtx.Rep_Id;
            var input = RepTakeInput();
            var reason = _repApprovalReason;
            var result = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                var svc = new AccountModelsLib.SalesRep.SalesRepOrderService();
                return request ? svc.RequestTakeApprovals(repId, input, reason) : svc.CheckTake(repId, input);
            });
            _repViolations = result.Violations;
            _repWarnings = result.Warnings;
            if (request) Snackbar.Add(Tr("FSVApprovalRequested"), Severity.Info);
            else if (result.Ok) Snackbar.Add(Tr("FSNCheckOk"), Severity.Success);
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _errorMessage = ex.Message; }
        finally { _isSaving = false; }
    }

    private async Task SaveRepAsync()
    {
        if (!CanSaveRep) return;
        _isSaving = true;
        _errorMessage = null;
        try
        {
            var repId = _repCtx!.Rep_Id;
            var input = RepTakeInput();
            var r = await Task.Run(() => { AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant(); return new AccountModelsLib.SalesRep.SalesRepOrderService().TakeOrder(repId, input); });
            Snackbar.Add(Tr("FSNSaved", r.Order_No), Severity.Success);
            Nav.NavigateTo($"/salesrep/orders?rep={repId}");
        }
        catch (AccountModelsLib.SalesRep.SalesRepApprovalRequiredException ex)
        {
            _repViolations = ex.Violations.ToList();
            _errorMessage = ex.Message;
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _errorMessage = Tr("SystemError", ex.Message); }
        finally { _isSaving = false; }
    }

